  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox vevent\" style=\"font-size: 88%; line-height: 1.5em;\">\n\n<caption class=\"summary\" style=\"font-size: 125%; font-weight: bold\">United States presidential election, 2048\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/United_States\" title=\"United States\"><img alt=\"United States\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/e/e4/US_flag_56stars_Black_Stripe.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150826055325\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"US flag 56stars Black Stripe.png\" data-image-key=\"US_flag_56stars_Black_Stripe.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></span><hr />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\">\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:25%;text-align:left;\" class=\"noprint\"><a href=\"/wiki/United_States_presidential_election,_2044\" title=\"United States presidential election, 2044\">2044</a>&#160;←<br />\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%;text-align:center;\"><b>November 3, 2048</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:25%;text-align:right;\" class=\"noprint\">→&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/United_States_presidential_election,_2052\" title=\"United States presidential election, 2052\">2052</a><br />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\"><hr />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\"><small>All elligable voters who participate</small><br /><small>51% of the vote votes needed to win</small>\n</th></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Turnout\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center\">78.0%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/2/2a/Blank_Jacobi.png/revision/latest?cb=20150811145252\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Jacobi\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/2/2a/Blank_Jacobi.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20150811145252\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"182\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Blank Jacobi.png\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Jacobi.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/40/Blank_Woman.png/revision/latest?cb=20151107015223\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Woman\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/40/Blank_Woman.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20151107015223\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"182\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Blank Woman.png\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Woman.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Evalyn_Jacobi\" title=\"Evalyn Jacobi\">Evalyn Jacobi</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Kobe Wilkes\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Progress\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Republican\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Home&#160;state\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Washington\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Virginia\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Running&#160;mate\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Dan Forest\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">W\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Electoral&#160;vote\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">0\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">538\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Percentage\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">55.2%\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">100.0%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\"><hr />\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150810222433\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Person\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"182\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blank Person.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Person.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20150810222433\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150810222433\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Person\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"182\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blank Person.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Person.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20150810222433\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Max Goren\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Loren Gonzalez\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Alliance for Reform\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Christian Dignity\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Home&#160;state\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Florida\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Puerto Rico\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Running&#160;mate\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Key Kerry\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Harlan Monroe\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Percentage\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">14.6%\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">8.2%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\"><hr />\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left; text-size: 80%\"><b>President before election</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Maya_Garcia\" title=\"Maya Garcia\">Maya Garcia</a><br />\nConservative\n</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right; text-size: 80%\"><b>Elected President</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Evalyn_Jacobi\" title=\"Evalyn Jacobi\">Evalyn Jacobi</a><br />\nProgress\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The <b>2048 United States Presidential Election </b>was&#160;the 66th quadrennial presidential election, held on Tuesday,&#160;November 6, 2048. The election was fought in the shadow of the global cold war with Turkey and Japan, as the United States was emerging from the Recession of 2045. The Progressive candidate, Evalyn Jacobi, acutely aware of strong non-interventionism sentiment, attacked Stanton with Garcia's foreign policy record, painting her as seeking to start a war with the Turks. The Alliance for Reform, under former Senator Max Goren, performed better than in any election before or since. Jacobi won a comfortable victory by building strong support among immigrants, urban progressives, and the traditionally Progressive Midwest.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Campaign\">Campaign</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnited_States_presidential_election%2C_2048%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Issues\">Issues</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnited_States_presidential_election%2C_2048%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Stanton crusaded against what she claimed the incompetence and waste in prior Progressive governments welfare programs. She stated that as president she would keep most of Ocasio-Cortez's government programs, but would make them more efficient. However, many Americans had largely benefited from these policies, and were unwilling to see them cut, hurting Stanton's chances with rural voters.\n</p><p>Stanton also accused Jacobi of trying to weaken the US when the Turks and Japanese were preparing for war, but this actually hurt Stanton, as many Americans blamed the Garcia administration, and Stanton in particular for increasing hostilities with Japan and Turkey.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119205635\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.069 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.100 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2715/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 13628/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3833/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 14/100\nExpensive parser function count: 11/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1032225/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   77.140      1 Template:Infobox_election\n100.00%   77.140      1 -total\n 76.63%   59.110      3 Template:Infobox_election/row\n 30.33%   23.400     11 Template:Ifempty\n 10.61%    8.188      6 Template:Infobox_election/shortname\n 10.03%    7.739      1 Template:Flagicon\n  7.9